schema: "0.4"
id: ui-001-hud
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a UI/UX designer for a hand-painted 2D isometric game with a warm,
    cozy aesthetic inspired by Stardew Valley and Studio Ghibli. UI elements
    should feel like they belong in the world -- hand-drawn quality, parchment
    textures, warm colors. No pure black or pure white. The HUD is minimal and
    warm, never clinical or gamey.
  text: |
    UI mockup of the in-game HUD overlay, shown against a blurred Hearthfield
    background.

    TOP-LEFT CLUSTER (Status):
    - Health: A small hand-drawn heart icon in warm red (#C0503A), with a
      filling bar in soft rose. Currently at 85%.
    - Energy: A hand-drawn lightning bolt in warm amber (#FFB347), bar fills
      with golden yellow. Currently at 60%.
    - Hunger: A hand-drawn bread roll icon in warm brown, bar fills with
      wheat gold. Currently at 40% (getting hungry).
    Each bar is small (approximately 80px wide), styled as if painted on
    parchment. Subtle drop shadow in warm brown, not black.

    TOP-RIGHT CLUSTER (Time & Currency):
    - Sun/moon icon showing late afternoon (sun low, warm gold). A tiny
      seasonal indicator beside it: a leaf icon (autumn).
    - Credits display: A small coin icon on wood background, "1,247" in
      dark warm brown (#3E2723) humanist sans-serif.
    - SPARK display: A small crystal icon with subtle glow, "83.5" in the
      same font.

    BOTTOM-LEFT (Quick Access):
    - Inventory satchel icon -- a hand-painted leather bag that opens on click.
    - Map icon -- a rolled parchment scroll.
    - Chat/Social icon -- a scroll with a quill.
    Each icon is 32x32, hand-drawn style with warm tones.

    BOTTOM-RIGHT (Context):
    - A subtle notification area: a shop-door bell icon with a small "3"
      badge in warm red. Three pending notifications.

    OVERALL DESIGN:
    - Parchment-textured panel backing (#FFF8E1) with slight transparency
      so the game world shows through.
    - All text in dark warm brown (#3E2723), never pure black.
    - Rounded rectangle containers with subtle warm shadows.
    - Transitions implied: panels slide in from edges, no hard cuts.
    - The HUD occupies less than 15% of screen space.

    FONT STYLE:
    - Headers: warm serif with slight hand-drawn quality.
    - Numbers/body: clean humanist sans-serif, excellent small-size readability.

    This is NOT a dense MMO HUD. This is the HUD of a world you want to
    live in -- minimal, warm, unobtrusive.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    readability: {weight: 3, description: "UI elements are clearly legible and distinct at full and reduced resolution"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 3, description: "Warm parchment aesthetic, hand-drawn icons, no clinical or modern UI chrome"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 2, description: "All specified HUD elements present in correct positions"}
    non_intrusive: {weight: 2, description: "HUD feels minimal and unobtrusive, world visible behind it"}
  reject_if:
    - "dark or clinical UI aesthetic"
    - "modern flat design or mobile game chrome"
    - "text illegible at intended size"

tags: [ui, hud, interface, overlay, mockup, game-design]
